<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Friday  show that net currency reserves fell to about 106.2 billion marks in the week ending October 15 from about 106.3 billion in the week ending October 7.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    Oct 15	  Oct 7</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     122.2	   122.1</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   16.0	    15.8</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
